        // writes the manifest JSON, deletes Syscall.stark, then re-imports Syscall into the
        // Demo consumer and inspects the loaded module's SyntaxModel (Syscall0 asm x86_64
        // "syscall"), the HighLevelIr BodyLoweringKind (AsmBypass) and the LlvmIrModule
        // text ("declare i64 @Syscall0(i64)", "call i64 @Syscall0(i64 39)", no "asm
        // sideeffect"). Package-image bytes, manifest round-tripping, filesystem effects and
