        // PORT-NOTE: the C# test publishes a Facade library with two Parse overloads, asserts
        // the manifest SourceSurface has two distinct Parse symbols, deletes the source,
        // re-imports Facade into the Demo consumer and inspects the TypeCheckModel overloads
        // and the SemanticValidation called-overloads (two distinct Facade.Parse#(...) keys).
        // Manifest round-tripping, filesystem effects and overload/semantic-model inspection
        // are not expressible via the helpers, so this resolves Facade through the filesystem
        // module resolver and asserts the Demo consumer (which calls both Parse overloads);
